<title>BELGIUM: EU to review Portugal sugar certificates complaint.</title>
<headline>EU to review Portugal sugar certificates complaint.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission will review a complaint by Portugal that it cannot get certificates of origin for Brazilian raw cane sugar imports to their destination ports on time, an EU official said on Friday.</p>
<p>The official said Portugal had complained to the European Union's sugar management committee.</p>
<p>Current regulations require certificates of origin to be at the port of arrival when shipments arrive.</p>
<p>--Brussels newsroom 322 287 6800</p>
</text>
